  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"93\">🪄 PlayStation 5 Game – Hogwarts Legacy | €23,99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"371\"><strong data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"136\">Hogwarts Legacy</strong> is een meeslepend open-wereld avontuur in de magische wereld van Harry Potter. Verken Zweinstein en omgeving, leer krachtige spreuken en beleef je eigen tovenaarsverhaal. Deze <strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"327\">PS5-versie</strong> is volledig getest en <strong data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"370\">direct speelbaar</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"390\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"555\">\r\n<li data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"422\">\r\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"422\"><strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"406\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"452\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"434\">Game:</strong> Hogwarts Legacy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"490\">\r\n<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"490\"><strong data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"465\">Genre:</strong> Actie / RPG / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"522\"><strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"507\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"555\">\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"555\"><strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"538\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikt, getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"570\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<li data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"622\">\r\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"622\">Grote open wereld in het Harry Potter-universum</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"657\">Eigen personage en verhaallijn</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"692\">Magische gevechten en spreuken</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"722\">Prachtige graphics op PS5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"750\">Direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"761\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"773\"><strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"773\">€ 23,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1152\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"> </p>",
